{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"dracula-soft","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Dracula Soft","description":"The popular purple and pink dark palette.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Dracula Soft","path":"themes/dracula-soft.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/dracula-soft.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Dracula Soft\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#282a36\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#f8f8f2\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#21222c\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#191a21\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#191a21\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#21222c\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#343746\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#44475a\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#343746\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#21222c\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#191a21\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#bd93f9\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#bd93f9\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#bd93f9\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#44475a\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#34374680\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#bd93f9\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#191a21\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#ff5555\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#50fa7b\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#ffb86c\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#ff5555\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#6272a4\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f1fa8c\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#bd93f9\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff79c6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8be9fd\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#50fa7b\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#bd93f9\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f8f8f2\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff79c6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#50fa7b\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffb86c\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Dracula Soft\n\nThe popular purple and pink dark palette.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Dracula Soft** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nPalette by the Dracula Theme project (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#282a36` |\n| Text | `#f8f8f2` |\n| Accent | `#bd93f9` |\n| Keywords | `#ff79c6` |\n| Strings | `#f1fa8c` |\n| Functions | `#50fa7b` |\n| Types | `#8be9fd` |\n| Comments | `#6272a4` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}